{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/clearnotificationcenter"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/clearNotificationCenter","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"abstract":[{"text":"Clears all delivered notifications from the notification center.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"clearNotificationCenter"}],"title":"clearNotificationCenter","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"clearNotificationCenter","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)clearNotificationCenter","role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"clearNotificationCenter","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Removes all notifications delivered by your app from the iOS Notification Center."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is commonly used when:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"User opens the app (clear notifications since they’re viewing content)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"User logs out (clear notifications for privacy)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Content is marked as read in-app"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Performing a “mark all as read” action","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only removes notifications from your app; other apps’ notifications are unaffected."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Clear notifications on app activation and logout:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class NotificationManager {","","    func applicationDidBecomeActive() {","        \/\/ Clear notifications when user opens app","        Pushwoosh.configure.clearNotificationCenter()","","        \/\/ Also reset badge","        UIApplication.shared.applicationIconBadgeNumber = 0","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(0)","    }","","    func handleUserLogout() {","        \/\/ Clear notifications for privacy","        Pushwoosh.configure.clearNotificationCenter()","","        \/\/ Unregister from push","        Pushwoosh.configure.unregisterForPushNotifications { _ in }","","        \/\/ Clear user identity","        Pushwoosh.configure.setUserId(\"\")","    }","","    func markAllAsRead() {","        \/\/ Clear from notification center","        Pushwoosh.configure.clearNotificationCenter()","","        \/\/ Update backend","        APIClient.shared.markAllNotificationsRead { _ in }","","        \/\/ Clear badge","        Pushwoosh.configure.sendBadges(0)","    }","}"]}]}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","title":"PWConfiguration","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PWConfiguration"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","role":"symbol","abstract":[]},